    135  f080							; ==============================================================================
    136  f080							; TitleBand — merged title, bands 1-3 (N=4 layout, 2026-10-24).
    137  f080							; Band 0 is drawn by the CAVE kernel (stage PF + COLUPF from the room buffers,
    138  f080							; player via PlayerColTable/Grp0Ptr), so the title reuses the real kernel
    139  f080							; instead of duplicating its band rendering. The bank0 row-advance tail
    140  f080							; diverts here when DropTarget=$FF, exactly where band 1 would start.
    141  f080							; This routine: band 1 = stage row 1 (PREVIEW ONLY), band 2 = the TITLE PAD
    142  f080							; (playfield blanked, 48px S.A.V.I.O.R. logo + credit footer), band 3 = stage
    143  f080							; row 3, then the HUD band (score = level+1, lives/bombs/bar via MenuMain).
    144  f080							; Why the split (user ruling 2026-10-24): with 36-line bands the text no longer
    145  f080							; fitted under the player inside band 1 — the miner (band 0, Y 24..35) ran
    146  f080							; straight into the logo. Preview up top, text one band lower, keeps the two
    147  f080							; cleanly apart. No object is drawn on the title: DropArm .DATitle clears
    148  f080							; EnemyCount/LevelMinerRoom and the laser on every title LoadLevel, so
    149  f080							; SelectActiveObject parks GRP1.
    150  f080							; Entered via CallPad_TitleBand ($FC55). ZP: LineCount ($84) + Temp ($88) as
    151  f080							; loop counter/tmp — idle on title frames (cave overscan bypassed).
    152  f080							; ==============================================================================
