    157  f080							; so the band-transition line keeps the left half on band 0.
    158  f080							; ==================================================================
    159  f080							; Cave band 0 leaves the missiles latched (the .AfterRows clear is
    160  f080							; skipped on the title) and may leave the player's last GRP row live:
    161  f080							; clear GRP with VDEL OFF first (a GRP write while VDELP=1 only reaches
    162  f080							; the delayed slot — AGENTS "VDEL stale live-slot"). The missiles STAY
    163  f080							; on: band 1 is a real room preview, so a latched M1 strip is the room's
    164  f080							; own geometry (band 2 clears it before the 48px text).
