   1373  f7fb							; Pad remaining scanlines to reach exactly 48 total
   1374  f7fb							; Path A (PlayerLives > 0) — execution count:
   1375  f7fb							;   Top gap:  6 (4 + 2 former ball-pos lines — elements keep lines)
   1376  f7fb							;   Timer:    3 loop + 1 gap = 4
   1377  f7fb							;   Lives:    3 SetObjectXPos (P0 lives 1-4, P1 lives 5-8, ball key) + 1 HMOVE
   1378  f7fb							;	       + 5 render + 1 gap = 10 (2026-10-27: +1 line, pad 7 -> 6)
   1379  f7fb							;   Bombs:    3 SetObjectXPos (P0, P1 miners, M0 5th bomb) + 1 HMOVE
   1380  f7fb							;	       + 5 render + 3 gap = 12 (2026-10-26: +1 line, pad 8 -> 7)
   1381  f7fb							;   Score:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 7 ScoreLoop = 10
   1382  f7fb							;   Subtotal: 6+4+10+12+10 = 42
   1383  f7fb							;   Pad:      48 - 42 = 6
   1384  f7fb							; Both lives paths run the same instructions (GRP0/GRP1 just stay 0),
   1385  f7fb							; so the band is 48 lines for every lives count and every key state.
   1386  f7fb							; ====================================================================
