   1817  fa95		       d0 19		      bne	.ULSOut	; bomb event owns channel 0
   1818  fa97		       a5 c0		      lda	LaserState
   1819  fa99		       10 15		      bpl	.ULSOut	; fire released -> ch0 stays silent
   1820  fa9b		       a5 c2		      lda	EnemyRamP
   1821  fa9d		       4a		      lsr
